cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite it as below."
title: "Schema Lab: an example publishing package for single-author microjournals"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-23"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ch'ng"
    given-names: "Ewe Seng"
    affiliation: "Universiti Sains Malaysia"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
abstract: >-
  A minimal, working example of a publishing package for a single-author
  microjournal. Articles are Markdown files checked against a versioned
  schema; one set of templates produces the web page, a matching PDF and the
  issue listing. Issues collect published articles automatically, schemas are
  locked once in use, and a manual workflow assigns each published article a
  Zenodo DOI, with a sandbox mode for testing.
keywords:
  - microjournal
  - schema-driven publishing
  - Jekyll
  - GitHub Pages
  - Zenodo
license: MIT
